# Instructor roadmap (mentions final exam content)
teaching/ROADMAP.md
# Exam room: the midterm paper and the test file with its model solution stay off GitHub until the exam is over.
# Copy them to the server by hand (server/examroom/README.md, "Getting the paper onto the server").
server/examroom/midterm.py
server/examroom/test_examroom.py
# Practice Linux Commands: the Super challenges (checkers and hidden inputs) stay off GitHub, like the midterm paper.
# Copy them to the server by hand (server/practice/README.md).
server/practice/private/
# Practice: the test holds working solutions to every public scenario (an answer key), like test_examroom.py.
server/practice/test_practice.py
server/practice/test_drills.py

# Exam scenario bank: the scenarios, their tests and the backups of the old paper stay off GitHub.
server/examroom/bank/
server/examroom/test_exambank.py
server/examroom/midterm-v1-backup.py
server/examroom/test_examroom-v1-backup.py
server/examroom/bank-review*.md
# Practice Linux Commands: the drills hold hints that give the command and checks that show the answer, and a test solves them;
# they go to the server by hand (server/practice/README.md), like the Super challenges. The instructor's plans stay private too.
server/practice/drills/
server/practice/test_roadmap_api.py
teaching/EXAM-BANK-PLAN.md
teaching/EXAM-TERMINAL-SPEC.md
teaching/PRACTICE-SCENARIOS-PLAN.md
